        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1.1(b)(2) Employees who work with confidential business information. The people in this group include all individuals in the Business Operations, in Internal Audit, in Communications and Public Affairs, in State and Local Government Relations and all Executive Office Administrators. Additionally, certain employees in the Finance Organizations in payroll, payment services, insurance, estimating/pricing, investment analysis, cost management,",
